You are a senior frontend architect and UI/UX expert.

Task: Refactor my existing UI into a clean, document-style professional layout similar to structured documentation tools (like Confluence / Word editor view).

STRICT REQUIREMENTS:

1. LAYOUT STRUCTURE
- Create a centered content container (max-width: 900px–1100px)
- Apply proper left and right margins (not full-width stretched UI)
- Maintain vertical reading flow (top → bottom document style)
- Add consistent spacing between sections (24px–32px)

2. TYPOGRAPHY SYSTEM
- Use clear hierarchy:

  Title (if present):
    font-size: 24px–28px
    font-weight: 600–700

  Section Headers (e.g., "Challenge", "Challenge Objectives"):
    font-size: 18px–20px
    font-weight: 600

