- Ensure bullets align vertically and are readable

5. SECTION DIVISION
- Add clear separation between sections:
  - spacing OR
  - subtle divider line (#eee or light gray)

6. VISUAL CLEANLINESS
- No heavy colors
- White or very light background
- Text color: #222 or #333
