8. DATA STRUCTURE SUPPORT
Ensure UI supports structured content like:

- Sections (Challenge, Objectives)
- Subsections (A, B, etc.)
- Paragraphs
- Bullet lists

9. COMPONENTIZATION (VERY IMPORTANT)
Break UI into reusable components:

- DocumentContainer
- SectionHeader
- SubSectionHeader
- Paragraph
- BulletList
- BulletItem

10. RESPONSIVENESS
- Maintain readability on smaller screens
- Reduce padding but keep structure intact

OUTPUT EXPECTATION:
- Refactor existing UI code (do NOT create a new project)
- Apply changes within current structure
- Keep code clean, modular, production-ready
- No unnecessary libraries

Focus on clarity, readability, and professional documentation-style UI.
